otograma cuenta la historia de Victor, un joven que es llevado de repente al infierno, donde se casa con una misteriosa Novia Cadáver, mientras que su verdadera novia, Victoria espera en el mundo de los vivos. A pesar de que la tierra de los muertos resulta ser más colorista que su estricta educación victoriana, Victor aprende que no hay nada en este mundo, ni en el siguiente, que pueda separarle de su único y verdadero amor.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Fantasía","Animación"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/3933","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2005,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:13:42.762Z"},{"id":"tv-338385","slug":"tv-338385","title":"حب أسود","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vBdqNzcB9QaFQ2xjhyMH0OrX7vf.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":14,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/338385-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:18:56.753Z"},{"id":"tv-226174","slug":"tv-226174","title":"Matlock","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nW0CEfL1u6JwTQ2wyEZbgMiClZl.jpg","synopsis":"Madeline Matlock se reincorpora a un prestigioso bufete de abogados, donde utiliza sus astutas tácticas para ganar casos y sacar a la luz irregularidades.","status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":35,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/226174-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2024,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:20:12.620Z"},{"id":"tv-302063","slug":"tv-302063","title":"Taşacak Bu Deniz","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uHIOTJXN9nNTc51WyunL43Fvge3.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"En emisión","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Familia","Soap"],"totalEpisodes":40,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/302063-tv","type":"flyflix","contentType":"series","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:20:40.553Z"},{"id":"tv-335052","slug":"tv-335052","title":"โคตรรัก","imag